    "title": "City of Arvada Pay Plan",
    "summary": "The City of Arvada has established a pay plan that outlines job titles, exemption statuses, and corresponding pay grades across various job families, including Executive and Information Technology. For example, the Deputy City Manager has an annual salary range from $192,751 to $263,558, while positions in the Information Technology family, such as IT Infrastructure Architect, have salaries ranging from $125,526 to $171,638. The pay structure includes annual, monthly, biweekly, and hourly salary details for each position.",
